WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.267
Okay,

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.267
a number series!

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:10.933
One,

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:11.567
three,

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:12.233
nine,

00:00:12.233 --> 00:00:12.900
twenty-seven,

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.233
and then...

00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:16.233
what comes next?

00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:16.900
A.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:17.567
Fifty-four,

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:18.200
B.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:18.867
Seventy-two,

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:19.533
C.

00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:20.200
Eighty-one,

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.533
or D.

00:00:21.533 --> 00:00:22.200
Ninety?

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.533
Five seconds!

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.500
TIME'S UP!

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:32.867
The answer is...

00:00:32.867 --> 00:00:33.433
C,

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:34.000
eighty-one!

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.400
Each number is multiplied by three:

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:37.967
one,

00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:38.533
three,

00:00:38.533 --> 00:00:39.100
nine,

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:39.667
twenty-seven,

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:43.100
so twenty-seven times three is eighty-one.

00:00:44.233 --> 00:00:44.633
So,

00:00:44.633 --> 00:00:46.667
are you smart or fart?

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:49.100
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.300
find your rank!

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:51.800
So,

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.200
how did you do?

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.567
Comment your score below,

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:55.933
and follow for more!
